      <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What is the best dipping sauce for DQ chicken strips?<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Country Gravy is the traditional and most popular pairing. Ranch is a close second. For something bolder, try the FlameThrower Sauced Basket which has spicy sauce tossed directly onto the strips.</div></div></div>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:32px;">Browse the full DQ food menu including burgers, breakfast, snacks, and all frozen treats on <a href="/"><strong>The Queen Dairy Menu</strong></a>.</p>
